### 1. Register a new Admin User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "custom_admin",
  "password": "adminpassword123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Register a new Staff User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "custom_staff",
  "password": "staffpassword123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### 3. Login as Admin (Pre-seeded user or custom_admin)
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "adminpassword"
}

### 4. Login as Staff (Pre-seeded user or custom_staff)
# @name staffLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "password": "staffpassword"
}

### 5. Get current user profile (Me endpoint, replace JWT_TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

### 6. Create Product - Success (Allowed for Admin or Staff, replace JWT_TOKEN)
# @name createProduct
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "category": "Peripherals",
  "quantity": 50,
  "price": 4500
}

### 7. Create Product - Suspicious Stock Anomaly Test (Quantity > 100, triggers security alert & Kafka event)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Huge Stock Order",
  "category": "Office Supply",
  "quantity": 180,
  "price": 150
}

### 8. Create Product - XSS Sanitization Failure Test (Should fail with 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor <script>alert('XSS')</script>",
  "category": "Screens",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 25000
}

### 9. Update Product - Normal (Replace PRODUCT_ID and JWT_TOKEN)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "category": "Peripherals",
  "quantity": 55,
  "price": 4800
}

### 10. Update Product - Suspicious Stock Change Anomaly Test (Replace PRODUCT_ID and JWT_TOKEN, change quantity by > 100)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "category": "Peripherals",
  "quantity": 160,
  "price": 4800
}

### 11. Delete Product as Staff (Should fail with 403 Forbidden and trigger security alert & Kafka event)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_JWT_TOKEN

### 12. Delete Product as Admin (Should succeed, replace PRODUCT_ID and ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

### 13. Get Audit Logs as Staff (Should fail with 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_JWT_TOKEN

### 14. Get Audit Logs as Admin (Should succeed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

### 15. Get Security Alerts as Staff (Should fail with 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/security-alerts
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_JWT_TOKEN

### 16. Get Security Alerts as Admin (Should succeed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/security-alerts
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
